  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>雲谷</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī你家己ē-tàng thí開翼股ê時tsūn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就是離開ê時候</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tuè風</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">沓沓仔　勻勻仔飛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無論kuân低　iah是緊慢　按照家己ê習慣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">已經m̄是hit个等待hông飼ê鳥仔囝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">後擺koh倒tńg--去ê時　本來ê厝to無--去--ah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">賰--ê kan-na新ê生活</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">重新開始　iáu是新ê循環</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh4-C-3M3n5ZoltXhCF0txh5_8ZSThBxStLy3fU19vUQPceZJYkX7OOGYzbJiC1nlq59i4vphutQp6zqOoBpaClVteiIEqFJxGTIrH6lMCnt7zwm9dQT_0cVQYnfxHMPDPQrkjmvV7-C2AavToHN6noR0lwFphE61AuQrRS1ryAVe_mgbGTrI4MTx1GCFZl/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1354%E6%9C%9F_01.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh4-C-3M3n5ZoltXhCF0txh5_8ZSThBxStLy3fU19vUQPceZJYkX7OOGYzbJiC1nlq59i4vphutQp6zqOoBpaClVteiIEqFJxGTIrH6lMCnt7zwm9dQT_0cVQYnfxHMPDPQrkjmvV7-C2AavToHN6noR0lwFphE61AuQrRS1ryAVe_mgbGTrI4MTx1GCFZl/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1354%E6%9C%9F_01.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgFni9p9mMTYzCKPxOQu5cxaBCLInQmAvDA0TLT436ok8uHqRoFipEAn-JSsrNSrTpszlNmRhk6bNV_gtU7YtJvg-pJmNohy5K9FEuhNmCIOaH0T41W-UWo66_7A1djVz4JojasFdCefmPZrm78o2TknbHiqNIjZzCWCTCmsnCdxu23rsI0RedognE3TulY/s1424/354%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgFni9p9mMTYzCKPxOQu5cxaBCLInQmAvDA0TLT436ok8uHqRoFipEAn-JSsrNSrTpszlNmRhk6bNV_gtU7YtJvg-pJmNohy5K9FEuhNmCIOaH0T41W-UWo66_7A1djVz4JojasFdCefmPZrm78o2TknbHiqNIjZzCWCTCmsnCdxu23rsI0RedognE3TulY/w450-h640/354%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#做伙來唸詩&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-coll